# Trusted signers of crosswalk release-candidate approvals (#792), OpenSSH
# allowed_signers format (ssh-keygen(1), "ALLOWED SIGNERS").
#
# Deliberately empty. Only the project owner adds a line here, with their own
# public key, in a change they make and merge themselves, for example:
#
#   <principal> namespaces="lovspor-crosswalk-approval" ssh-ed25519 AAAA...
#
# No tool, agent or script writes, generates or chooses this key. While no
# line is present every approval is refused, so no release candidate can be
# made or described.
